{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck of Citizen cards to defend your kingdom from various monsters. Each Card acts as a unit on board, and a Citizen in your kingdom. During the day you will play your cards to defeat grizzly monsters  at the gates of your kingdom. You will also make choices in dynamic story events, that will shape the future of your kingdom, and your people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Invite over 100 Different Citizen to your kingdom, all with unique effects!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night you will get the option to invite a Citizen to your kindom! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/e29d14ccb3dc2d077ab0d1104caaf353.poster.avif?t=1771964909\" width=1120 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/e29d14ccb3dc2d077ab0d1104caaf353.webm?t=1771964909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/e29d14ccb3dc2d077ab0d1104caaf353.mp4?t=1771964909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your kingdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each season you will return home, here you can spend the money you've earned on building landmarks to expand your kingdom. Each landmark also comes with an effect, so be mindful where you place them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/7e3031e771e98ed580557e4eec9fc0b9.poster.avif?t=1771964909\" width=1120 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/7e3031e771e98ed580557e4eec9fc0b9.webm?t=1771964909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/7e3031e771e98ed580557e4eec9fc0b9.mp4?t=1771964909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend against monsters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every season there will be a new threat at your gate, make sure they are dealt with before they reach your Haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/265b33255b4d7fdbf9fad390ae665fdc.poster.avif?t=1771964909\" width=1120 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/265b33255b4d7fdbf9fad390ae665fdc.webm?t=1771964909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/265b33255b4d7fdbf9fad390ae665fdc.mp4?t=1771964909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050260?t=1771964909","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/1f31974e604295ec236d7d6a1b890affca367fce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771964909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/a5c236618914ae1ded6f468b579b35fb1715d5c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771964909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/a5c236618914ae1ded6f468b579b35fb1715d5c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771964909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Inp